# Only files that may be shared go into git (see README.md). Everything else you put
# here (ROMs, BIOS files, saves, commercial game data) stays on your PC.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!.gitkeep
!README.md
!config/gamepads.txt
!apps/Education/**
!Tyrian/data/**
!roms/doom/doom1.wad
!roms/quake/id1/pak0.pak
!roms/neogeo/gngeo_data.zip
